  "bio": "Helena Borges is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist based in Florianópolis, Brazil, with a specialty in fineline and floral styles. She creates unique and exclusive designs, putting her heart into every piece and maintaining a high level of professionalism. Her talent is recognized and awarded confirming her ability to transform skin into extraordinary works of art.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Florianópolis, Santa Catarina, Brazil\n\nTatuadora há 8 anos, especialista em traços finos, mini realismo,  pets e colorido, com arte autoral e exclusiva por cliente.\nOrçamento link abaixo 📩",
